* [`av.fq.all_polarizations_product`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Abelian-varieties-over-Fq/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_av___fq___all_polarizations_product_FLQQ_--statement) — (In)decomposable polarized abelian variety. Difficulty: very hard. Note: Missing: Polarisations of abelian varieties (dual abelian variety, Poincaré bundle) and products of polarised abelian varieties; (in)decomposability is then a one-line definition. Roadmap: PR \#1720 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/AbelianVarietiesOverFiniteFields/README.md §10.3 Principally polarized abelian surfaces, lines 1893–1895; §10.5 The resultant-one obstruction, lines 1993–1998

