* [`ec.q.modular_degree`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Elliptic-curves/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_ec___q___modular_degree_FLQQ_--statement) — Modular degree of an elliptic curve over \$\\mathbb Q\$. Difficulty: very hard. GitHub issues: [#27](https://github.com/CBirkbeck/LeanBridge/issues/27). Note: Missing: Modular parametrisations X₀(N) → E over ℚ (X₀(N) as a curve over ℚ) and their degrees. Roadmap: PR \#1715 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/EllipticCurvePeriodsAndModularParametrizations/README.md §4.6 The modular degree, lines 1222–1225
* [`ec.q.modular_parametrization`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Elliptic-curves/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_ec___q___modular_parametrization_FLQQ_--statement) — Modular parametrization of an elliptic curve over \$\\mathbb Q\$. Difficulty: very hard. GitHub issues: [#27](https://github.com/CBirkbeck/LeanBridge/issues/27). Note: Missing: X₀(N) as a curve over ℚ and non-constant morphisms X₀(N) → E over ℚ. Roadmap: PR \#1018: TauCetiRoadmap/EllipticCurveModularity/README.md Layer R29.5 Quotient isogenies and modular parametrisations, subsection "The morphism from X₀ at the conductor", lines 1517–1525
* [`ec.q.optimal`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Elliptic-curves/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_ec___q___optimal_FLQQ_--statement) — Optimal elliptic curve over \$\\mathbb Q\$. Difficulty: very hard. Note: Missing: X₀(N) over ℚ, its Jacobian J₀(N), and optimal quotients J₀(N) → E (with connected kernel). Roadmap: PR \#1715 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/EllipticCurvePeriodsAndModularParametrizations/README.md §4.2 X₀(N)-optimality, lines 1095–1131 (summary §4.11, line 1936)

# Varieties › Genus 2 curves

* [`g2c.conductor`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Genus-2-curves/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_g2c___conductor_FLQQ_--statement) — Conductor of a genus 2 curve. Difficulty: very hard. GitHub issues: [#44](https://github.com/CBirkbeck/LeanBridge/issues/44). Note: Missing: The conductor of the Jacobian of a genus 2 curve: conductors of abelian varieties (inertia invariants of V\_ℓA and the Swan conductor of A\[ℓ\]) and Jacobians, or the ℓ-adic Galois module Pic⁰(X\_ℚ̄)\[ℓ\^∞\] in their place. Roadmap: PR \#1707 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/HyperellipticCurves/README.md §5.6 The conductor of a genus-2 Jacobian over ℚ, lines 2168–2181
* [`g2c.galois_rep_image`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Genus-2-curves/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_g2c___galois_rep_image_FLQQ_--statement) — Image of mod p Galois Representation of Jacobian of genus 2 curve. Difficulty: very hard. Note: Missing: Mod-ℓ images of genus 2 Jacobians in GSp₄(𝔽\_ℓ), and the Mitchell types irred, cusp, 1p3, 2p2, nss, which the knowl names but does not define. Roadmap: PR \#1727 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/AdelicImagesAndModularCurves/README.md §7.3 Subgroup types of GSp₄(𝔽\_ℓ) and Mitchell's classification, lines 1887–1925
* [`g2c.local_root_number`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Genus-2-curves/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_g2c___local_root_number_FLQQ_--statement) — Local root number. Difficulty: very hard. GitHub issues: [#44](https://github.com/CBirkbeck/LeanBridge/issues/44). Note: Missing: Local root numbers (ε-factors of the ℓ-adic or Weil–Deligne representation of the Jacobian) of higher-genus curves at finite places. Roadmap: PR \#1707 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/HyperellipticCurves/README.md §4.12 Root numbers, lines 1919–1941
* [`g2c.regulator`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Genus-2-curves/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_g2c___regulator_FLQQ_--statement) — Regulator of a genus 2 curve. Difficulty: very hard. Note: Missing: Néron–Tate heights on Jacobians of genus 2 curves (ag.canonical\_height) and the Mordell–Weil group of the Jacobian. Roadmap: PR \#1017: TauCetiRoadmap/HeightsRationalPointsAndObstructions/README.md §1.8 Positive definiteness and regulators, lines 623–630 (Néron–Tate heights and pairing: §§0.19–0.21, lines 327–360)

