# Varieties › Miscellaneous

* [`av.hyperelliptic_count`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Varieties-miscellaneous/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_av___hyperelliptic_count_FLQQ_--statement) — Number of hyperelliptic Jacobians. Difficulty: very hard. Note: Missing: Principally polarized abelian varieties and the canonical polarization of Jacobians (dual abelian varieties), to count the hyperelliptic Jacobians in an isogeny class up to polarized isomorphism. Roadmap: PR \#1720 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/AbelianVarietiesOverFiniteFields/README.md §10.6 Jacobian and hyperelliptic counts, lines 2034–2036
* [`av.jacobian_count`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Varieties-miscellaneous/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_av___jacobian_count_FLQQ_--statement) — Number of Jacobians. Difficulty: very hard. Note: Missing: Principally polarized abelian varieties and the canonical polarization of Jacobians (dual abelian varieties), to count the Jacobians in an isogeny class up to polarized isomorphism. Roadmap: PR \#1720 (draft): TauCetiRoadmap/AbelianVarietiesOverFiniteFields/README.md §10.6 Jacobian and hyperelliptic counts, line 2021 (also 2035–2036)
* [`av.polarization`](https://cbirkbeck.github.io/LeanBridge/Varieties/Varieties-miscellaneous/#--informal-preview-_FLQQ_av___polarization_FLQQ_--statement) — Polarization. Difficulty: very hard, theory. *Blocked by:* the dual abelian variety (representability of Pic⁰), the Poincaré bundle and polarizations Note: Missing: The dual abelian variety (representability of Pic⁰ of an abelian variety), the Poincaré bundle and polarisations, with their degree and kernel. Roadmap: TauCetiRoadmap/JacobianChallenge/README.md:387
